{{!-- ======================================================================
      HALAMAN 3 — FORM BUKU
      Satu berkas templat dipakai untuk dua keperluan sekaligus (tambah dan
      ubah). Perbedaannya hanya pada nilai variabel `mode` dan `action` yang
      dikirim controller — penerapan prinsip reusability pada sisi tampilan.
     ====================================================================== --}}

<div class="row justify-content-center">
  <div class="col-lg-9">

    {{#if errors.length}}
      <div class="alert alert-danger">
        <div class="fw-semibold mb-2">
          <i class="bi bi-x-octagon-fill me-1"></i> Data belum dapat disimpan:
        </div>
        <ul class="mb-0 ps-3">
          {{#each errors}}<li>{{this}}</li>{{/each}}
        </ul>
      </div>
    {{/if}}

    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-header">
        <span>
          {{#if (eq mode 'new')}}
            <i class="bi bi-plus-circle me-2"></i>Formulir Tambah Buku
          {{else}}
            <i class="bi bi-pencil-square me-2"></i>Formulir Ubah Buku
          {{/if}}
        </span>
        <a href="/books" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary">
          <i class="bi bi-arrow-left"></i> Kembali
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="card-body">
        <form method="POST" action="{{action}}">
          <div class="row g-3">

            <div class="col-md-4">
              <label class="form-label">Kode Buku <span class="text-danger">*</span></label>
              <input type="text" name="code" class="form-control" required maxlength="20"
                     placeholder="BK-011" value="{{book.code}}">
              <div class="form-text">Kode unik, tidak boleh sama dengan buku lain.</div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-8">
              <label class="form-label">Judul Buku <span class="text-danger">*</span></label>
              <input type="text" name="title" class="form-control" required maxlength="150"
                     placeholder="Masukkan judul buku" value="{{book.title}}">
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6">
              <label class="form-label">Pengarang <span class="text-danger">*</span></label>
              <input type="text" name="author" class="form-control" required maxlength="100"
                     placeholder="Nama pengarang" value="{{book.author}}">
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6">
              <label class="form-label">Penerbit</label>
              <input type="text" name="publisher" class="form-control" maxlength="100"
                     placeholder="Nama penerbit" value="{{book.publisher}}">
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-4">
              <label class="form-label">Tahun Terbit <span class="text-danger">*</span></label>
              <input type="number" name="publishedYear" class="form-control" required
                     min="1900" max="2100" value="{{book.publishedYear}}">
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-4">
              <label class="form-label">Kategori <span class="text-danger">*</span></label>
              <select name="category" class="form-select" required>
                {{#each categories}}
                  <option value="{{this}}" {{#if (eq this ../book.category)}}selected{{/if}}>
                    {{this}}
                  </option>
                {{/each}}
              </select>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-4">
              <label class="form-label">Jumlah Stok <span class="text-danger">*</span></label>
              <input type="number" name="stock" class="form-control" required min="1"
                     value="{{book.stock}}">
              <div class="form-text">Total eksemplar yang dimiliki perpustakaan.</div>
            </div>

          </div>

          <hr class="my-4">

          <div class="d-flex gap-2">
            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">
              <i class="bi bi-save me-1"></i>
              {{#if (eq mode 'new')}}Simpan Buku{{else}}Simpan Perubahan{{/if}}
            </button>
            <a href="/books" class="btn btn-outline-secondary">Batal</a>
          </div>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="alert alert-light border mt-3 mb-0 small">
      <i class="bi bi-shield-check text-success me-1"></i>
      Seluruh isian di atas divalidasi ulang di sisi server memakai library
      <b>class-validator</b>, sehingga data tetap aman walaupun validasi
      bawaan peramban dilewati.
    </div>

  </div>
</div>
